{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act35side_level_act35side_09_beg",
  "groupId": "act35side",
  "stageId": "act35side_09",
  "title": "向過去告別",
  "storyCode": "AS-9",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_09_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2367a9e9ead810d50525af0286b0ca6b4d4f0e1271f2545d63bd3c287b165365",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "歡迎來到這裡，佩佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這便是沙阿所留下的寶庫嗎？和博物館好像……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的感知是正確的，在我記憶還未恢復的時候，就覺得城中有些地方似曾相識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在建立城市的過程中，我想他們或許是參考了陵寢的修建風格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡到底有什麼，祖拜爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "牆壁上的油燈燃起，光線在如鏡面般光滑的牆體與支柱間遊走，昏暗的大廳變得明亮。\n一時之間，無數猶如鬼魂一般的虛影，齊齊出現在大廳之中，或行或立。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來在沙阿的寶庫中藏著的寶物……都是他自己啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來他這麼自戀的嗎……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然不是，這些影像都是姐姐讓我保存在這裡的，自父親離去後，姐姐一直很想念他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "千年前，史官們透過發掘到的古代科技，保存了父親的一言一行，無不栩栩如生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在阿爾薩蘭地區也找到了類似的物品，在晶洞中，它為我展示了一段沙阿的影像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那正是我留下的，我以為會有夢魘後裔找到那段影像，然後順著線索找過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你把它藏得太隱祕了，祖拜爾，別人肯定找不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隱祕？我可是在外面主持修建了一座巨大的神廟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來它沒能抵禦歲月的侵蝕，在我到達的時候，那裡已經是一片頹唐破敗的廢墟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但它還是指引你來到了這裡，並且將我喚醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這正是歲月變遷的奇妙之處，一些當時看來派不上用場的安排，也會因為一系列陰差陽錯，作用出美妙的巧合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來這裡還有沙阿摘下面具的樣子……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣的影像我不僅僅在阿爾薩蘭見過，小時候，我和弟弟捉迷藏，誤入了一間存放棺槨與亡者的密室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然有家學教導，知道自己遲早要接觸到這些，但讓一個孩子獨自面對這些還是過於勉強了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當時我慌張失措，不知是誤觸了什麼機關，見到了一段沙阿的影像，但我對他毫無認知，只當他是一個試圖與自己溝通的鬼魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他告訴我，這些棺槨只是一段被掩埋在沙土中的歷史。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當後來人將它發掘後，會架起一座跨越時間的橋樑，讓我們跨過漫漫歷史長河，彼此相識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我記得這句話……當時母親去世，姐姐靠在棺槨上流淚不止，這是父親蹲下來安慰她的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還記得，姐姐成為史官後，父親常叮囑她的話，要關注……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要關注那些讓英雄成為英雄的——歷史的背面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……原來你已經聽過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是那段影像最後留下的話，我一直記著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "看著路加薩爾古斯的影像，佩佩突然覺得有些荒誕。\n一路的追尋中，她曾無數次地想像過沙阿的寶庫中究竟保存著什麼。\n但此刻她突然意識到，自己所謂的執著與追尋，不過是從一個虛影到另一個虛影。\n她抓緊手中的重錘，竭力忍住想要揮動它驅散眼前影子的衝動。\n更讓她覺得恐懼的是，自己家族所謂的職責與傳承，又何嘗不是一道虛影呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梅捷緹克緹女士，我按照通訊錄把其他員工都聯絡了一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有不怕死願意過來幫忙的人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不確定，大多數人回答得都很複雜……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……謝謝你，你能再幫阿娜特女士找幾瓶水來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好的，梅捷緹克緹女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……像吉雅阿和妮雅阿一樣不知道害怕的人，終究還是少數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿娜特，我們現在也許只有兩個小時。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其實現在立刻向城外逃跑，才是最好的辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，緹緹，我在比對城市測繪記錄，無法分心想那麼多……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你應該知道，我和你留在這裡的原因一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……職責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是那兩個遊客呢？她們和祖拜爾的復活沒有任何關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她們甚至和這座城市也沒有什麼關係……現在我們卻讓她們進入下水道，去做最危險的探查工作，想辦法堵住灌進來的沙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我只能盡我最大的努力，讓她們的勇氣不會被浪費。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我幫你捏捏耳朵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝你，緹緹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，你看，這一段施工日誌提到了異常地質結構。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——好，我立刻記錄下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "緹緹，你說，我關於祖拜爾先生的研究最終也沒發表，我們死前對城市地下結構的摸索也沒機會讓人知道……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒能留下自己的“名”，就這麼死掉，父親豈不是會很失望？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就都怪佩佩，都是我們尊敬的帕夏之女太有本事導致的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷緹克緹",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——拉恕爾先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，博物館現在處於緊急情況，沒有時間接待您，尊敬的監管人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請不要用敬語，我已經不是監管人了。我只是一個重獲自由民身分的，被赦免的工匠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但現在博物館無法保證任何人的安全，我們能給出的最誠摯的建議，就是用一切手段盡快離開城市中心……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……交出現有的一切之後，我陪伴著祖拜爾先生在緩緩流下的黃沙前站了一段時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您見到了祖拜爾先生？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我看著他試圖用法術修補一尊又一尊陶瓷雕塑，但最後停下來，對我說，“我們的職責如此”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白，職責便是你我堅持到最後，絕不問為什麼的東西……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即使結果並不如人願。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請問，為了讓這座城市不被毀滅，我能做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看好了，這次該我展示首領的指揮能力了。很快你就會相信，自己應該聽我的安排，留在博物館裡保護其他人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "從這裡往左轉，我們又會繞回剛才走過的那條路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我在下水道裡轉了這麼多天，怎麼沒遇到過這麼鬼打牆的事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先說好，我以往率領手下行動的時候從不迷路，這不是我的能力問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也不認為這是你的能力問題。或許讓人迷路正是這些曲折甬道本來的作用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博物館的正副兩位館長翻找歷年測繪資料的時候，我聽到了幾句討論內容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她們似乎認為，我們所處的舊下水道只是這座城市地下結構的一小部分。也許透過歷史資料，她們能推測出通往更深層的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她們最近一直在協助一位考古學家尋找線索，而那些線索指向的很可能是古籍中被稱為“寶庫”的建築遺址。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果這座城市深處真的藏著另一幢宏大建築的遺址……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有寶庫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……沒什麼，當我沒說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你似乎並不害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "害怕什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們的任務不就是找到漏沙子的區域，關閉那一段的閘門？如果閘門壞了，就用我們扛著的材料直接堵上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我們很有可能找不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，那……是有點可惜。要是我們失敗了，城市就會被埋進沙子裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過我們在地下，我們會最先看到沙子漫上來，也許還來得及用通訊提醒博物館裡的人趕快跑，只不過我們自己就跑不掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……等等。你是因為這個才堅持要來下水道的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為這個任務有生命危險，這種時候你必須站在最前面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "娜仁圖亞，阿斯帕齊婭，聽得到嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……聽得到，我們在一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們有了一些頭緒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們注意一下周圍的聲音，應該能找到拉恕爾的發條羽獸……一些藍色的，羽獸外形的機械。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們推測出了一些可能存在深層結構的位置，如果你們能幫發條羽獸在牆壁上打開縫隙，這些羽獸可以飛過去收集資訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "掌握足夠的資訊之後，我們應該能找到黃沙湧入的確切位置，但是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "發條羽獸並不能承擔關閉機關、填堵裂隙一類的工作……抱歉，你們可能要親自涉險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想你一定在我向你展示的記憶中留意到了，你的額飾，和我姐姐頭上的一模一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這枚額飾我們家族代代相傳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我以前也曾疑惑過，為何我的家族世代堅守著為萬王之王記敘作傳的職責，問父親，父親也不知道從何而起，只說是天職如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來答案竟是這樣簡單，不過是源自一個孩子對父親的思念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姐姐一直堅信，父親終究有天會回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但很可惜，直到離世，她都沒有等到，而我，也沒來得及去見她最後一面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姐姐死後，只有父親的虛影陪同我繼續走下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佩佩，放下去黃金之城的執念吧，我知道如何將意識封存進寶石，亦知曉如何打造不朽的身軀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你會有永恆的生命去經歷，去發現，去記述……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很抱歉……祖拜爾……我並不能代替你的姐姐陪伴你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也有弟弟，他在黃金之城擔任史官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真是遺憾，那可不是什麼好職位，他們知道太多不能呈現在紙面上的東西了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我那愚蠢的王兄為了讓史官按照他的心意記述歷史，強行要求姐姐將自己的雙胞胎兒子之一送進王宮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想不到千年後，這樣的脅迫變成了榮光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那位獸主說，所有史官都會被割去舌頭，這是真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不清楚現任萬王之王如何行事，但這確實是行之有效的保密方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……無論如何，我都要去黃金之城找他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就知道……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就離開吧，佩佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不……我還不能離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這座城市，我不能棄之不顧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不能放任構裝體繼續在城裡作亂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放過這裡吧，就像你說的，那些最為珍貴的寶物還沒有被玷污。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，佩佩，即使我想要停下來，也無法停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人的一生會經歷大大小小的抉擇，它們相互嵌套著，在無窮的分支路徑中為每個人刻畫出獨一無二的迴路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我對父親的誓言，對姐姐的誓言，已經被刻成迴路，永遠留在這些寶石之上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我絕不可能違背它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有一絲可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那祖拜爾，告訴我，我該如何停下構裝體呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已經告訴你答案了，佩佩，接下來，要靠你自己的努力了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "像當時那些前來進犯的軍隊一樣，盡全力抓住我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其實那天和阿雅吉阿雅妮聊過之後，我一直覺得有些事情應該告訴你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這石頭真夠難敲，但願我們的時間還夠……她們說了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "藍色的發條羽獸在二人頭頂盤旋著，催促她們鑿開眼前的石磚。\n阿斯帕齊婭很慶幸一切如此順利，在踏入那條可能的通路之前，自己只剩下一件事情要做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我得知了你渴望財富的緣由。你覺得自己欠了過去的手下一筆債。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喔。從哪裡講起的？我們倉皇逃命的那個晚上，還是所有財寶都被我給出去的時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "從你離開之後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我從阿雅吉和阿雅妮那裡聽到了很多故事。她們去伐木場工作總是用蠻力弄壞鋸子，幫人看店把帳本記得一團糟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "趁你不在，有人提刀殺了自己最後一隻馱獸，賣刀換了鍋具，宴請眾人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……然後他的廚藝名揚全鎮，在市集裡開了家小吃店，每天顧客絡繹不絕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有人把當沙盜的經歷寫成了故事，在小報上連載，廣受好評，據說現在已經編到你們穿越千年時間，去搶沙阿的王座。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大多數人都有間房屋，不會隨季節遷徙，來得及在雨季前補好屋頂，讓它不漏雨。你的那些手下，如今依然過得不差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……這我當然知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我尊敬你，但我認為你不欠他們什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像你也沒有必要救一座城，只為了救兩個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你應該逃出去，然後回去看看……再然後，放下你的擔子，你的“職責”，往前走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "巨石緩緩滑動的隆隆聲打斷了阿斯帕齊婭。\n二人合力鑿石的動作彷彿觸動了古老迷宮的關竅，那塊有著斑駁浮雕的石磚猛地退入河道的牆體內。幾秒鐘後，她們聽見石頭的墜落聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "接著，整片牆體開始崩塌，但正如阿娜特所言，牆外並不是黃沙。\n一片空蕩蕩的黑暗昭示著她們正面對著某種龐大建築的內部。\n她們眼前也並沒有路。流沙聲無比清晰地從深處傳來，彷彿深淵之下是豐水期奔騰的河流。\n一條踏入便有去無回的河流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在那一瞬間，她們極具默契地同時扔下手中的鐵鎬，拔出了武器。\n沙塵揚起，二人拉出不到十步的距離。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要幹嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阻止你跳下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不對吧，剛剛不是我在攔著你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我之前就想說了，你如果是為了送死才來的，我可不能放任你往前走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還以為你比那兩個傢伙可靠，沒想到你也是個需要我搭救的手下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我說過了，你不必承擔這樣的職責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你誤會我了。我只是想自己去看看，並且相信自己比任何人都適合去做這件事，僅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像，即使不是為了讓手下重新過上好日子，我還是會想要堆成山的金子。沒辦法，我就是這麼貪心嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“人的一生會經歷大大小小的抉擇。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你把這個叫職責，但我比較喜歡說，這是我自己選的。這就是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好啦，既然你是個訓練有素的格鬥家，不會往刀口上撞，那現在我要認真了，你千萬不要生氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我對你只有真心的感謝，娜仁圖亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在，我不必畏懼與你展開一場真正的對決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我曾經不敢相信我的內心，因為我跟隨家族立下的誓言……關乎鮮血與暴力，視戰爭為最公正的踐踏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但如今我已見過堅定之人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或許薩爾貢人的信念也有其可取之處。我由我做出的抉擇構成，因此從今往後——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——喂！你怎麼不等我說完——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她的視野突然變得一片黑暗。\n展開的黑色刀扇自眼前掠過，閉眼又睜眼的一瞬間，下水道中僅有的燈光被徹底吞沒。\n她的確記得娜仁圖亞還有兩把黑色的刀，帶有機關，無法直接從鞘中抽出。\n但那一瞬間她只是想起，歷史中有一支神民庫蘭塔被稱為夢魘，因為他們曾不分日夜行軍，在正午時吞噬太陽。\n她憑藉記憶衝向對方所在的位置——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——然後撲了個空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一點利用沙子的障眼法，一點源石技藝製造的幻覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰說只有打出輸贏這一種做法的？搶先跳下去不就行了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在黑夜與幻象的簇擁之中，娜仁圖亞後退了一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齊婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，娜仁圖亞！這不是公正的對決！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁圖亞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看，你又拿了一枚銀牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祖拜爾，你是認真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你一邊指引我攻擊你，一邊又跑得飛快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是早點放棄比較好，佩佩，我告訴過你了，不管如何嘗試都只會是無用功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算你再用力揮舞那把重錘，也碰不到我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，看不起誰啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉……你是打算靠砸斷這間大廳的支撐點來縮小我活動的範圍嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那可不是什麼好方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "說話間，流沙湧過，那些斷裂的石柱與破碎的地面便恢復如初。\n佩佩穿過一個又一個虛影，尋找著祖拜爾的身影。\n但往往餘光才捕捉到他的袍角，下一秒他便藏身於眾多虛影之後，再難尋覓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你還需要再專心一點，佩佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道嗎，祖拜爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我十四歲之前，醫生曾經判斷我是個孱弱的孩子，像這樣的重錘，終身都無法舉起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你現在看起來瘦小，卻已能將它揮舞生風了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒錯，為了能夠深入沙漠與雨林，尋找那些失落的古蹟進行考古，我拜託薩爾貢著名的力士對我進行訓練。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到十七歲時，我已經可以獨自穿越廣闊的沙漠，一力對抗數十個沙匪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佩佩，光靠這些是不夠的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我並非想向你展現自己的能力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是想告訴你，從小到大，只要我下定決心去做，就沒有做不到的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不論那些目標再難，再苦……只要我想要……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就一定會做到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，佩佩，你之所以會有這樣的錯覺，不過是因為你才活了二十二年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當年，我在父親麾下效力，無數擁上來的敵人都被我斬於劍下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽到他們的哀鳴令我何其自信，以為假以時日，世間沒有得不到的東西，沒有做不到的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殊不知，我這一生最大的敵人，正是漫漫時光！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "金影掠過，還來不及轉頭，佩佩便感受到自己的腳踝處傳來劇痛。\n那根手杖遠比想像中還要沉重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你需要快一點了，佩佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殺死每一個侵犯父親陵寢的人，是寫在我的源石迴路上的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的不停攻擊，已經讓它感覺到惱怒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它開始催促我，早點結束這一切了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不該和我玩這個遊戲的，祖拜爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這場戰鬥並非遊戲，佩佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，它是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，竟然閉上了眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "眼前漆黑一片，佩佩知道，自己的眼睛不夠敏銳，只會是拖累。\n小的時候，在花園中玩捉迷藏，無論如何努力，自己都抓不到身手敏捷的弟弟，那小子簡直滑得像一條鱗。\n直到某天，她偶然閉上眼睛，發現弟弟踏在石板上的腳步聲竟是如此清晰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那小子就在我身後……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "只要我轉身轉得夠快……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我就能抓到他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "閉緊雙眼，佩佩使盡全力將重錘向身前揮去，不出意料，她聽到了響亮的碎裂聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
